    GUARD "待て!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:12
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_45e957f2:

    # GUARD "What business have you here?"
    GUARD "ここで、何のご用でいて？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:15
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_b78b2653:

    # "The guard snatched the paper and looked it over for a moment before nodding."
    "衛兵はその書類をひったくると、しばらく目を通してからうなずいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:16
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_f775d541:

    # GUARD "Apologises for the zealousness, there have been some... {i}Issues{/i} recently."
    GUARD "熱心さゆえに申し訳ありません、最近...少し{i}問題{/i}がありまして。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:17
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_0cfeed7c:

    # MC @ talk "Issues?"
    MC @ talk "問題？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:18
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_db8ed9e5:

    # GUARD "Captain Nyx will explain everything, I'm sure."
    GUARD "キャプテン・ニクスがきっと全てを説明してくれるでしょうね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:19
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_7587ce3e:

    # GUARD "You can find her in the Captains' office."
    GUARD "彼女は艦長室にいます。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:25
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_86251c30:

    # NYX @ talk "Ah, you must be on the one Officer Lukkan sent."
    NYX @ talk "ああ、ルッカン警官が送ってくれた方ですね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:26
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_d1ba2341:

    # MC @ talk "What gave it away?"
    MC @ talk "何でわかった？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:27
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_d58791e6:

    # NYX @ laugh "Because people who know me are usually already pissing themselves."
    NYX @ laugh "私を知っている者は、大抵もう腰を抜かしているからな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:28
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_850124c1:

    # NYX @ talk "Which tells me you don't know me, which tells me Lukkan sent you."
    NYX @ talk "ということは、君は俺を知らないってことだ。なら、ルッカンが送り込んだな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:30
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_729481fd:

    # "The guard gritted his teeth."
    "衛兵は歯を食いしばった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:31
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_1aed4b73:

    # GUARD "Not before I run you through...!"
    GUARD "先に斬り伏せるまでは…!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:34
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_8e7b7010:

    # NYX @ angry "Stop! What is all this commotion?"
    NYX @ angry "やめて!これはどういう騒ぎだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:35
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_ce949a2c:

    # GUARD "This man wishes to speak to you, Captain."
    GUARD "この者があなたに、キャプテンにお話ししたいと申しております。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:36
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_1470ada4:

    # NYX @ talk "Hm? Oh, you must be the one Lukkan sent."
    NYX @ talk "ふむ？ ああ、君がルッカンが送ってきたってわけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:37
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_b453b162:

    # NYX @ talk "Stand down and let him through."
    NYX @ talk "下がれ、彼を通させろ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:38
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_4851d3c6:

    # GUARD "But-"
    GUARD "でもー"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:39
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_266d52f6:

    # NYX @ angry "That was an order, not a request."
    NYX @ angry "それは頼みではなく、命令だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:40
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_19d2c49e:

    # GUARD "...Yes ma'am."
    GUARD "…かしこまりました、お嬢様。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:41
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_25e04db1:

    # GUARD "You may proceed."
    GUARD "先に進んで良い。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:47
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_8c8a82db:

    # NYX @ angry "You do know I can have you thrown in a cell for threatening guards like that."
    NYX @ angry "護衛を脅すような真似をすれば、独房にぶち込まれるんだぞ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:48
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_a14d861d:

    # MC @ talk "I don't really like being told what to do."
    MC @ talk "あんまり命令されるのは好きじゃないな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:49
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_924be6cd:

    # NYX @ angry "Hmph, well you better get used to it."
    NYX @ angry "ふん、まあ慣れたほうがいいわよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:50
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_f905f88e:

    # NYX @ angry "The only way to get anywhere here is to learn when to kiss ass and shut up."
    NYX @ angry "ここで出世する唯一の方法は、ゴマをする時と黙っている時を見極めることだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:53
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_8557ad27:

    # NYX @ shock "Oh, {i}really?{/i} Would you like to get to know me better with my boot up your fucking ass?"
    NYX @ shock "{i}本当に？{/i}俺のブーツでケツを蹴り上げてほしいってか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:54
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_74a11e6f:

    # NYX @ angry "Pay attention, I'm not one of your sluts, nor am I here to fuck around with some happy go lucky {i}'Adventurer'{/i}..."
    NYX @ angry "いいか、私はお前の女郎じゃないし、どこかの陽気な{i}冒険者{/i}の遊び相手になる訳じゃないんだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:55
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_1d6bf6ef:

    # NYX @ angry "...whose probably gonna get skullfucked to death by a pissed off Demorai soon anyway."
    NYX @ angry "…どうせ近いうちに、怒り狂ったデモライに頭蓋骨を犯されて死ぬんだろうけどな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:59
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_02682086:

    # NYX @ talk "Your services are called upon to serve the Kingdom once again."
    NYX @ talk "貴殿のご助力を、再び王国のためにお願いしたい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:60
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_d9e10f0a:

    # NYX @ talk "I don't know how aware you are with how 'fragile' things can be in this city, but suffice to say, I'm in need of a sellsword like yourself."
    NYX @ talk "この街でどれほど物事が『脆く』なり得るか、君がどの程度認識しているかは知らないが、端的に言えば、私は君のような傭兵を必要としているのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:61
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_6f18111b:

    # NYX @ talk "You'll be well compensated for your services."
    NYX @ talk "あなたの貢献には十分な報酬を支払いましょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:62
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_4b2d3807:

    # MC @ talk "Depends on the job."
    MC @ talk "仕事による。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:63
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_d2a7d24e:

    # NYX @ talk "These last few months, we've seen an explosion in banditry around the city."
    NYX @ talk "ここ数か月、都市周辺で盗賊団の活動が急増している。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:64
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_b450829f:

    # NYX @ talk "It seems some of the smaller crime factions inside the city have splintered, and the ensuing chaos is spilling out onto the street."
    NYX @ talk "市内の小さな犯罪組織の一部が分裂を始め、その混乱が街中に飛び火しているようだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:65
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_87b2aadb:

    # NYX @ angry "Soon the fuckers will be trying to rob people in bloody daylight if we don't stomp it out now."
    NYX @ angry "今のうちに潰しておかないと、野郎共が白昼堂々と人を襲うようになるぞ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:66
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_5090010f:

    # NYX @ talk "I want you to go out and send a message."
    NYX @ talk "君に出かけてメッセージを送ってほしい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:67
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_b860df6b:

    # NYX @ talk "Find them, and take them out."
    NYX @ talk "見つけ出せ、そして始末しろ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:68
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_c2211533:

    # NYX @ angry "I'll string up a few of the bodies when you're done, then they'll know not to fuck around."
    NYX @ angry "作業が終わったら数体を晒しものに吊るしておく。そうすれば、奴らも悪さを考えるのをやめるさ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:72
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_f1792b2d:

    # NYX @ angry "Because we're stretched thin enough as it is, Alcott keeps pulling my men into whatever division he thinks is most important for the day and he's leaving me severely short-handed."
    NYX @ angry "手一杯なのに、アルコットが毎日勝手に最重要部署だと言っては俺の部下を引き抜いていくから、深刻な人手不足に陥ってるんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:73
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_a52b06f6:

    # NYX @ angry "The fucker's so busy worrying about the enemy beyond the wall, he forgets about the threats from within."
    NYX @ angry "壁の向こうの敵ばかり気にかけて、内側からの脅威を忘れているとはな、あのヤツ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:74
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_7d5932ee:

    # MC @ talk "I take it you don't approve of his leadership?"
    MC @ talk "彼のリーダーシップは認めてないってこと？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:75
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_3443fedc:

    # NYX @ talk "Better than Mesamor, but even the best fruit is doomed to fall if the tree's rotten."
    NYX @ talk "メサモアよりも優れていても、木が腐っていれば、最高の果実でさえ落ちる運命にある。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:76
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_97dfcab2:

    # MC @ talk "That's... quite the metaphor."
    MC @ talk "それは...なかなかの比喩ですね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:77
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_a6180854:

    # NYX @ talk "We can discuss politics all you want when you're done."
    NYX @ talk "政治の話は終わったら好きなだけしましょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:82
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_5e99b9b0:

    # NYX @ angry "In case you really are this stupid, let me spell it out for you."
    NYX @ angry "ほんとうにバカなのか、はっきり言ってやる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:83
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_29fee2e8:

    # NYX @ angry "{i}We. Do. Not. Have. The. Men.{/i}"
    NYX @ angry "{i}戦力が　足りません{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:84
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_f7b66a95:

    # NYX @ angry "What do you expect me to do? Kill all the bandits by myself?"
    NYX @ angry "どうしろっていうんだ？俺一人で山賊を皆殺しにしろってのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:85
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_c94421e2:

    # NYX @ talk "Not to mention the fact they've actively started laying traps for us now."
    NYX @ talk "いうまでもなく、奴らは今や積極的に罠を仕掛けてきている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:86
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_c8d8ea69:

    # MC @ talk "Laying traps?"
    MC @ talk "罠を仕掛ける？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:87
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_77df70a0:

    # NYX @ talk "Yep, baiting us into tight alleyways or feeding us false information."
    NYX @ talk "はい、私たちを狭い路地におびき出したり、虚偽の情報を流したりするものです。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:88
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_52f4e6ce:

    # NYX @ angry "They've managed to ambush and take out a few of us like that, sneaky bastards, the lot of them."
    NYX @ angry "あの連中、そうやって何度か待ち伏せてやがって、卑怯な野郎どもめ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:89
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_9267291e:

    # NYX @ talk "Something drastic needs to be done, something that will bring them back into line."
    NYX @ talk "何か思い切ったことをしなければ、彼らを再び従わせるようなことを。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:94
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_ab515118:

    # NYX @ smile "Feeling a little bloodthirsty today, aren't we?"
    NYX @ smile "今日はちょっと血に飢えてるみたいね？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:95
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_a9c73586:

    # NYX @ laugh "Never mind, I just wish the rest of my men shared your enthusiasm."
    NYX @ laugh "気にするな、ただ他の部下たちも君と同じ熱意を持ってくれればと思うだけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:96
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_f25df481:

    # NYX @ angry "Half of them act like they've just had their balls cut off."
    NYX @ angry "半数は目の前で金玉を取られたような顔をしている"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:101
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_8961b27f:

    # NYX @ angry "Do you really think if things weren't that bad, Lukkan would be calling upon someone from the fucking Adventurers Guild of all things to help me out?"
    NYX @ angry "事態がそれほど切迫してなかったら、ルッカンが俺を助けるために、なんでくそったれの冒険者ギルドなんかに人を呼ぶと思うのかよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:102
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_57c218cb:

    # MC @ angry "What's wrong with the Adventurers Guild?"
    MC @ angry "冒険者ギルドはどうかしたのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:103
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_17a86af6:

    # NYX @ smile "Haha! Wow, you are new to all this, aren't you?"
    NYX @ smile "ハハ!うわ、本当に初心者だな、そうだろ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:104
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_53359bec:

    # NYX @ angry "I'll tell you what, do your job, and maybe I'll tell you my 'opinions' on the Adventure Guild afterwards."
    NYX @ angry "言っておくが、お前はお前の仕事をしろ。そしたら後でアドベンチャーギルドについての『意見』を聞かせてやるかもしれない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:110
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_a2abb0bb:

    # NYX @ talk "Finally."
    NYX @ talk "やっと。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:111
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_83e60d6b:

    # NYX @ talk "So... Can I count on you with this?"
    NYX @ talk "それで…これ、頼める？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:114
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_b0f2fa21:

    # NYX @ smile "Finally, someone useful around here."
    NYX @ smile "やっと、役に立つ人物が現れたね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:115
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_3fda12e3:

    # NYX @ talk "Good, I look forward to hearing your progress."
    NYX @ talk "よろしい、今後の進捗を楽しみにしています。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:116
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_17ec0421:

    # NYX @ talk "Remember, I need at least three groups of them slain, try wandering around at night and seeing what you find."
    NYX @ talk "忘れるな、少なくとも三つの群れを倒す必要がある。夜にさまよってみて、何が見つかるか試してみるといい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:121
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_d6b43d78:

    # NYX @ angry "Well, don't think too long, either you do it, or I have to find some other idiot to fill in for you."
    NYX @ angry "いいか、長く考えるな。お前がやるか、さもなくば他の馬鹿にお前の代わりを務めさせればいいんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:125
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_a2ca27cc:

    # NYX @ talk "Yeah, I need you to patrol the streets at night."
    NYX @ talk "ああ、夜の街をパトロールしてほしいんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:126
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_36b1eb9b:

    # NYX @ talk "Deal with at least three bandit groups."
    NYX @ talk "少なくとも三組の盗賊団に対応する。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:127
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_83e60d6b:

    # NYX @ talk "So... Can I count on you with this?"
    NYX @ talk "じゃあ…君に頼っていいかな？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:130
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_a949c99b:

    # NYX @ laugh "Finally, someone useful around here."
    NYX @ laugh "やっとこの辺りで役に立つ人間が出てきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:131
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_3fda12e3:

    # NYX @ talk "Good, I look forward to hearing your progress."
    NYX @ talk "よろしい、あなたの進捗を楽しみにしている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:135
translate ja qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOfficeRevisit_16f82085:

    # NYX @ angry "Well don't think too long, either you do it, or I have to find some other idiot to fill in for you."
